  "transcription": "Add MS a 94$^{18(96)}$ (96) (4)\n\n(1.72) $x(1+x+x^3+x^6+\\dots)(1+x^7+x^{21}+x^{42}+\\dots)$\n$= \\frac{x}{1-x} - \\frac{x^3}{1-x^3} - \\frac{x^5}{1-x^5} + \\frac{x^9}{1-x^9} + \\frac{x^{11}}{1-x^{11}}$\n$- \\frac{x^{13}}{1-x^{13}} + \\frac{x^{15}}{1-x^{15}} - \\frac{x^{17}}{1-x^{17}} - \\dots$\n(1.81) $\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x^{m^2+mn+n^2} = 1+6\\Big(\\frac{x}{1-x} - \\frac{x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{x^4}{1-x^4}$\n$- \\frac{x^5}{1-x^5} + \\dots\\Big)$\n(1.82) $\\Big\\{\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x^{m^2+mn+n^2}\\Big\\}^2$\n$= 1+12\\Big(\\frac{x}{1-x} + \\frac{2x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{4x^4}{1-x^4} + \\frac{5x^5}{1-x^5}+\\dots\\Big)$\n(1.83) $\\Big\\{\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x^{m^2+mn+n^2}\\Big\\}^3$\n$= 1 - 9\\Big(\\frac{1^2x}{1-x} - \\frac{2^2x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{4^2x^4}{1-x^4} - \\dots\\Big)$\n$+ 27\\Big(\\frac{1^2x}{1+x+x^2} + \\frac{2^2x^2}{1+x^2+x^4} + \\frac{3^2x^3}{1+x^3+x^6}+\\dots\\Big)$\n(1.84) $\\Big\\{\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x^{m^2+mn+n^2}\\Big\\}^4$\n$= 1+24\\Big(\\frac{1^3x}{1-x} + \\frac{2^3x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{3^3x^3}{1-x^3}+\\dots\\Big)$\n$+ 8\\Big(\\frac{3^3x^3}{1-x^3} + \\frac{6^3x^6}{1-x^6} + \\frac{9^3x^9}{1-x^9}+\\dots\\Big).$\n(1.91) $\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x^{m^2+mn+2n^2}$\n$= 1+2\\Big(\\frac{x}{1-x} + \\frac{x^2}{1-x^2} - \\frac{x^3}{1-x^3} + \\frac{x^4}{1-x^4} - \\frac{x^5}{1-x^5}$\n$- \\frac{x^6}{1-x^6} + \\frac{x^8}{1-x^8} + \\frac{x^9}{1-x^9} - \\frac{x^{10}}{1-x^{10}} + \\dots\\Big)$\n(1.92) $\\Big\\{\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty}\\sum_{-\\infty}^{\\infty} x^{m^2+mn+2n^2}\\Big\\}^2$\n$= 1+4\\Big(\\frac{x}{1-x} + \\frac{2x^2}{1-x^2} + \\frac{3x^3}{1-x^3} + \\frac{4x^4}{1-x^4} + \\frac{5x^5}{1-x^5} + \\frac{6x^6}{1-x^6}$\n$+ \\frac{8x^8}{1-x^8} + \\dots\\Big)$",
